# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): scenes: a tap, a blend by pressure, let go, undo, redo. Rendered by this branch and by main;
# a change that keeps the sound gives the same samples. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
pressure w0 0
pressure w1 0
pressure w2 0
pressure w3 0
pressure w4 0
pressure w5 0
pressure w6 0
pressure w7 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
set 71 30
set 74 0
press SEL
tapkey w12
release SEL
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SAVE
tapkey w0
release SAVE
spin K2 -40
spin K1 5
spin K3 -3
press SAVE
tapkey w1
release SAVE
wait 500
wav scenes.wav
tapkey w0
wait 3000
key w1 down
pressure w1 70
wait 2500
pressure w1 0
key w1 up
wait 2000
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 2500
press SEL
tap SAVE
release SEL
wait 2500
wavstop
